<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Advanced Fitness Hub</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  * { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;}
  body { background:#f4f4f4; color:#333; line-height:1.6;}
  header { background:#111; color:#fff; padding:20px 0; text-align:center;}
  header h1 { font-size:2.5rem;}
  nav { margin-top:10px;}
  nav a { color:#fff; margin:0 15px; text-decoration:none; font-weight:700;}
  nav a:hover { color:#ff4b2b;}
  section { padding:60px 20px; max-width:1200px; margin:auto;}
  .hero { background:linear-gradient(to right,#ff416c,#ff4b2b); color:#fff; text-align:center; padding:100px 20px;}
  .hero h2 { font-size:3rem; margin-bottom:20px;}
  .hero p { font-size:1.2rem;}
  .features { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr)); gap:20px;}
  .feature { background:#fff; padding:20px; border-radius:12px; box-shadow:0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); text-align:center;}
  .feature h3 { margin-bottom:10px; color:#ff4b2b;}
  .program { margin-bottom:30px; background:#fff; padding:20px; border-radius:10px; box-shadow:0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);}
  .about, .contact { background:#fff; border-radius:12px; box-shadow:0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);}
  form { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:15px;}
  input, textarea { padding:10px; border-radius:6px; border:1px solid #ccc; width:100%;}
  button { padding:10px; border:none; border-radius:6px; background:#ff4b2b; color:#fff; font-weight:bold; cursor:pointer;}
  button:hover { background:#ff416c;}
  footer { text-align:center; padding:20px 0; background:#111; color:#fff; margin-top:40px;}
  @media(max-width:768px){ .hero h2{ font-size:2.2rem;} }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
<h1>Advanced Fitness Hub</h1>
<nav>
  <a href="#home">Home</a>
  <a href="#programs">Programs</a>
  <a href="#about">About</a>
  <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
</nav>
</header>

<section id="home" class="hero">
<h2>Science-Based Calisthenics Training</h2>
<p>Master proper form, increase strength, and track progress with AI-guided programs for all levels.</p>
</section>

<section id="programs" class="features">
<div class="feature">
<h3>Beginner Program</h3>
<p>Step-by-step routines focusing on correct form and gradual strength building.</p>
</div>
<div class="feature">
<h3>Intermediate Program</h3>
<p>Progressive workouts incorporating more advanced exercises and intensity.</p>
</div>
<div class="feature">
<h3>Advanced Program</h3>
<p>Challenging routines designed for peak performance with detailed tracking.</p>
</div>
<div class="feature">
<h3>AI Custom Plans</h3>
<p>Personalized programs generated based on your goals, stats, and progress.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section id="about" class="about">
<h2>About Advanced Fitness Hub</h2>
<p>Our platform combines science-based calisthenics principles with AI insights to deliver highly effective workouts. We focus on proper form, progressive overload, and measurable results for every fitness level.</p>
</section>

<section id="contact" class="contact">
<h2>Contact Us</h2>
<form>
<input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Your Name" required>
<input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Your Email" required>
<textarea name="message" rows="5" placeholder="Your Message" required></textarea>
<button type="submit">Send Message</button>
</form>
</section>

<section id="detailed-programs">
<h2 style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:30px;">Sample Workouts</h2>

<div class="program">
<h3>Push-Up Progression</h3>
<ul>
<li>Beginner: Wall Push-Ups → Knee Push-Ups → Standard Push-Ups</li>
<li>Intermediate: Incline Push-Ups → Decline Push-Ups → Diamond Push-Ups</li>
<li>Advanced: One-Arm Push-Ups → Explosive Clap Push-Ups → Weighted Push-Ups</li>
</ul>
</div>

<div class="program">
<h3>Pull-Up Progression</h3>
<ul>
<li>Beginner: Assisted Pull-Ups → Negative Pull-Ups → Standard Pull-Ups</li>
<li>Intermediate: Weighted Pull-Ups → Wide Grip Pull-Ups</li>
<li>Advanced: Muscle-Ups → One-Arm Pull-Ups</li>
</ul>
</div>

<div class="program">
<h3>Core Strength</h3>
<ul>
<li>Beginner: Plank 20s → Side Plank 15s → Hollow Hold 15s</li>
<li>Intermediate: Plank 60s → Hanging Leg Raises → Russian Twists</li>
<li>Advanced: L-Sit → Dragon Flags → V-Ups</li>
</ul>
</div>

</section>

<footer>
<p>© 2025 Advanced Fitness Hub. All rights reserved.</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
